msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0008-output-as-persistence.md:19 8988023a629e4c2d9471c134945a5478
msgid ""
"**以 `output/` 目录为事实来源**（方案 B）。每次计算结果自动写入 `output/` 对应子目录，GUI 启动时扫描并重建 "
"Project。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0008-output-as-persistence.md:21 d703aaaa6a4a429298da7ea06c8acf00
msgid "文件命名约定保持与现有 output/ 结构兼容："
msgstr ""

